diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index cd25310..6e832c3 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,11 +4,14 @@ A small to-do list kept in a JSON file: `$TODO_FILE`, or `todo.json` in the curr
 
 ## Usage
 
-    python3 todo.py add buy milk     # prints "added 1"
-    python3 todo.py list             # "1 [ ] buy milk"
-    python3 todo.py done 1           # marks item 1 done: "1 [x] buy milk"
+    python3 todo.py add buy milk                    # prints "added 1"
+    python3 todo.py add --priority high fix roof    # "added 2"
+    python3 todo.py list                            # "2 [ ] fix roof (high)", "1 [ ] buy milk"
+    python3 todo.py done 1                          # marks item 1 done: "1 [x] buy milk"
 
-`list` prints one line per item, `<id> [ ] <text>`, with `[x]` for done items, in id order.
+`--priority` is `high`, `normal` (the default), or `low`. `list` prints one line per item,
+`<id> [ ] <text>`, with `[x]` for done items and ` (high)` or ` (low)` at the end unless the
+priority is normal. High items come first, then normal, then low, each in id order.
 
 ## Tests
 
